<title>SUDAN: Sudanese president leaves on Libya trip.</title>
<headline>Sudanese president leaves on Libya trip.</headline>
<dateline>KHARTOUM 1997-04-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sudanese President Omar Hassan al-Bashir left Khartoum on a visit to Libya on Friday, state television said.</p>
<p>It said he was accompanied by Foreign Minister Ali Osman Mohammad Taha.</p>
<p>They must travel by land because Libya is under a United Nations air embargo for refusing to hand over two suspects wanted for the bombing of a Pan Am airliner over Scotland in 1988.</p>
